y putting a  bunch of different scenery elements  together and shaping a different element  with it so anyway this is the small very  minor Japanese garden ish environment I  guess then I was building around the  building  it's not exactly a great Japanese going  and I have to say it's also lacking a  lot of typical foliage although I am  very glad that we got the cherry blossom  tree in the game which is absolutely  beautiful it's the the pink blossom tree  up there  on the top right and it looks really  amazing I love that one probably going  to use that one a bit more often but  yeah the rest is just some shrubs that I  sunk into the ground some simple rock  work to kind of symbolize the mountains  and some Scots pines  then I'm trying to imitate Japanese pine  trees with and with that said that is  the entire build so I'd like to thank  you guys for watching if you're  interested in checking this build out  you can find it on the Steam Workshop  I'll leave a link down in the  description and I hope to see you guys  in the next planet soo video bye guys  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]
 

